## DO
- Run `pytest` and `pre-commit` locally before every push
- Fix all lint and format issues — never skip with `--no-verify`
- Ensure new code has corresponding tests before pushing

## DON'T
- Don't use `git push --no-verify` to bypass hooks
- Don't push directly to `main` or `develop` without passing tests
- Don't ignore `pytest` warnings — treat them as errors in CI